Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:04.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.13,0:00:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,血印不会让宿主轻易死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark of cain never lets its host die easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.32,0:00:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过是个诅咒 是可以去掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a curse. It can be removed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.31,0:00:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.67,0:00:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里 有种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was something about being there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.87,0:00:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分时候是上下左右受敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most days felt like 360-degree combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得纯粹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It felt pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.07,0:00:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡思伯特·辛克莱尔 被封为「咒文大师」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuthbert Sinclair. He was named "Master of spells."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.01,0:00:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的作为变得有些疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His work got a little crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.47,0:00:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,领导层说他「怪异」「不负责任」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The leadership called it "Eccentric and irresponsible."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.45,0:00:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.12,0:00:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你选了温家兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're choosing the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.62,0:00:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选择我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm choosing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:34.09,Title,0,0,0,0,,《诅咒之书》是一本咒语书\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The book of the damned" is a spell book.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.09,0:00:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是用来创造或解开所有诅咒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}for creating or undoing any kind of damnation there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.92,0:00:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们如果能翻译过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We translate this thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.01,0:00:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得就能把你的该隐血印去掉 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we can get the Mark of Cain off you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.85,0:00:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信任你 但我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't trust you, but I need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.34,0:00:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要把该隐血印从我哥哥身上弄掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the mark of Cain off of my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.54,0:00:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我觉得你能破解这本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something tells me you can crack this book.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.30,0:00:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的问题是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only question is,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.64,0:00:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会帮我吗 - 我们谈谈条件吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will you help me? - Shall we discuss terms?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.74,0:01:00.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（密苏里州 圣路易斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.53,0:01:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 滚开 - 我的节目刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get lost. - My show just started.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.35,0:01:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你房间里有唱片机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a record player in your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.72,0:01:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老爸的扬声器更好 - 那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad's speakers are better. - Tough luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.99,0:01:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,得把衣服洗上 工人终于走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the laundry started. The workmen have finally left.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.57,0:01:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我要忙着准备晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the day, and I have my hands full with dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.80,0:01:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,少拿女权跟我说事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And please, none of your Betty Friedan stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.14,0:01:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总让我做家务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I always get stuck with the hard chores.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.42,0:01:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为我是女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}just 'cause I'm the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.74,0:01:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Well, tough luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.72,0:01:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,房子很不错 泰德\N{\fnArial\fs30}The house is great, Ted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有待修缮 但真的很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bit of a fixer, but it's a real beaut.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.63,0:01:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,前几年一直受产权纠纷困扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was caught in some ownership muddle for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.40,0:01:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但终于出售了 我立刻就买下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But finally hit the market, and I leapt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在下面待一整天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't spend all day down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.45,0:03:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 妈妈呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, where's mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.64,0:04:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.86,0:04:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,布拉德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brad?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.24,0:04:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.77,0:04:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.35,0:04:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.26,0:04:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.86,0:04:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.21,0:04:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.85,0:04:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第10季第19集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.04,0:04:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你可以帮我做\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could possibly do for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.43,0:04:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我自己却暂时做不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I can't, at least presently, do for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.51,0:04:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.90,0:05:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道我要杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's expecting it from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.38,0:05:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经让他讨厌的手下提高警惕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already has his stinking minions on high alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.89,0:05:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在想 一个母亲怎么会到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you're wondering how a mother can get to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.19,0:05:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想害死亲生子的地步… - 我真没想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- of wanting her own son… - No, I'm really not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.28,0:05:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.24,0:05:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我替你杀了克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.91,0:05:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的事先说\N{\fnArial\fs30}First things first…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.46,0:05:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能读懂这本书吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you read the book?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.91,0:05:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.11,0:05:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能是当今在世\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm likely the only witch alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.73,0:05:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一能理解这么古老的黑魔法的女巫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}who can understand such old, dark magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.67,0:05:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是目前这样子读不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just not in its present form.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.07,0:05:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒水我请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.50,0:05:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪都别想去 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going anywhere, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.05,0:05:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的死敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your mortal enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.55,0:05:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾试图杀你和你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've tried to kill you and your brother…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,试图杀你哥还是上个月的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother as recently as last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.07,0:05:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是走投无路 你才不会来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't have come to me if I wasn't your last resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经没别的办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.27,0:05:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再假装不是这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can stop pretending you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.69,0:05:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}So rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.54,0:06:02.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（迪恩 在塔尔萨突袭一个巢穴 要来自便）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.24,0:06:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 书现在这样我是读不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…I can't read the book in its present form,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.97,0:06:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有个人读得懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is someone who could.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.32,0:06:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜迪娅 大巫师团的女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nadya. Grand coven witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.95,0:06:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪能找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do I find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.98,0:06:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,找不到 她已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't. She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.55,0:06:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,早死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.67,0:06:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为毕生的工作被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murdered for her life's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.31,0:06:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她的解码公式 她的法典\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her decryption formulas, her codex…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.87,0:06:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个你是找得到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.18,0:06:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,把娜迪娅的法典拿来给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me Nadya's codex, and I'll…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.60,0:06:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就能破解密文\N{\fnArial\fs30}break this text right open.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.47,0:06:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,把破咒办法告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and give you your cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.05,0:06:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去哪找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是你 就从家里找起\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I were you, I'd start at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.87,0:06:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为是谁杀了娜迪娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you think murdered Nadya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.21,0:06:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷了她的法典啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stole the codex in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.34,0:06:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The men of letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.31,0:07:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,中奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.66,0:07:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened? What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.40,0:07:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.70,0:07:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个吸血鬼 我一人干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six vamps. Solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.25,0:07:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对打破个人最好成绩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that's gotta be a personal best.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.18,0:07:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就不能等等吗 - 等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You couldn't have waited?! - For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.12,0:07:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等什么 - 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For what? - Oh, come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.51,0:07:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能应付得来 我应付过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can handle it. I did handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.03,0:07:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 万一你应付不来呢 - 这不是没事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What if you couldn't? - But I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.22,0:07:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,都干完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 只有这样我才能消除紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. It's the only way I can take the edge off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉了 我并不是总喜欢等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I don't always like to wait around for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.64,0:07:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其你还老那么看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially with you looking at me like that all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.55,0:07:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么看你了 - 那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look at you like what? - Like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.21,0:08:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像我是得了病的疯狂杀人犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I'm some sort of a-a-a diseased killer puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.02,0:08:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.55,0:08:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一身臭汗和吸血鬼血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sweaty and I'm covered in vamp juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.25,0:08:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能回头再说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we just talk about this later?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.55,0:08:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想赶紧回地堡 喝点小酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to get back to the bunker, get my buzz on,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.66,0:08:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.42,0:08:12.11,Title,0,0,0,0,,看《生死时速2 怒海红颜》睡过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass out watching "Speed 2: cruise control."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.82,0:08:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.17,0:08:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:37.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（记录者会议纪要 56年5月16日 另见 开除卡思伯特·辛克莱尔）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.10,0:09:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,会议正式召开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, let come to order.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.33,0:09:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,记录者会议纪要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men of letters meeting minutes…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.92,0:09:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,1956年5月16日\N{\fnArial\fs30}May 16, 1956.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.93,0:09:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨论开除卡思伯特·辛克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the matter of Cuthbert Sinclair expulsion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.16,0:09:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这已经不是你的初犯了 卡思伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is hardly your first offence, Cuthbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.77,0:09:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你任职期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been cited for disciplinary infractions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.54,0:09:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾七次违反纪律\N{\fnArial\fs30}seven times in the course of your tenure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.26,0:09:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个施了法术的地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}This…enchanted vault of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.23,0:09:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}this…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.40,0:09:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,「维特箱」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Werther box."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.10,0:09:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,被施以强效保护咒 以至于理论上能达到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A warding so potent it achieves a theoretical rate of…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.10,0:09:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的原话是 「98%的致死率」\N{\fnArial\fs30}in your own words, "98% lethality."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.65,0:09:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须采取极端手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extreme measures were warranted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.59,0:09:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫师团为夺回法典不择手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}The coven's desperate to get the codex back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.73,0:09:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,维特箱能保护好法典\N{\fnArial\fs30}The werther box works.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.04,0:09:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,太过头了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All too well, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.14,0:09:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你秘密行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working in secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.46,0:09:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不受监管启动这个项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}embarking on this project without oversight…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.34,0:09:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你使得两名记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left two fellow men of letters vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.53,0:09:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,被你强大的魔法所伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}to your most potent magics.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.41,0:09:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱彻和马丁纳兹都是声誉很好的成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fletcher and Martinez were members in good standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.15,0:10:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱彻试图打开箱子 两小时内就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fletcher chanced upon the box and died in two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.17,0:10:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁纳兹英勇地企图中止魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martinez heroically tried to shut it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.66,0:10:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,却死在箱子旁边的地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found him dead on the floor beside the box,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.59,0:10:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,手腕被割开\N{\fnArial\fs30}his wrists cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.04,0:10:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经为这起意外道过歉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already apologized for that accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再道一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I refuse to do so again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.76,0:10:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么目光这么狭隘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you all so small-minded?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.63,0:10:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被带来这里 是为成就伟业\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were brought here to do great things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}To take risks,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.25,0:10:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为把这世界上的怪物赶尽杀绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bring the fight to the monsters of this world…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.18,0:10:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 你们全部\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, to a man,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.25,0:10:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,选择躲在这些书堆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}you choose instead to moulder in these stacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.90,0:10:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是男人 你们不配做男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not men. You are not men.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.68,0:10:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就是一群图书管理员而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're librarians. Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.28,0:10:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.71,0:10:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何处置你做出裁决前\N{\fnArial\fs30}on what is to be done with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.39,0:11:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要再给你一次争取宽大的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm prepared to give you a chance to secure our leniency.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.36,0:11:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们如何中止魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us how to shut it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.69,0:11:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,箱子和法典还在圣路易斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The box is still in St. Louis with the codex.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.95,0:11:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,依然是个威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still a danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.20,0:11:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你你该怎么发挥你的宽大吧 马卡姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you what you can do with your leniency, Markham.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.49,0:11:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.70,0:11:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就明白你们的意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the writing on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.65,0:11:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你们这群胆小鬼会中止项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you cowards would shut this project down,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.24,0:11:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才把它打造成那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is why I built it the way I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.82,0:11:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,想中止维特只有一个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is only one way to silence the Werther for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.63,0:11:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说吧 马丁纳兹的思路是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just say Martinez was on the right track.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.05,0:11:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你们根本没这个胆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt you lot have the guts,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.03,0:11:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过尽管拼死一试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're welcome to die trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.18,0:12:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,马卡姆 要我们继续尝试吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Markham, would you have us keep trying?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.20,0:12:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就地埋葬并守护箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The box is to be interred and guarded where it stands,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.92,0:12:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,永不得打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}in perpetuity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.15,0:12:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,埋好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bury it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.81,0:12:37.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣路易斯分部 密苏里州 圣路易斯 德菲街2111号）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.46,0:13:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点早了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bit early.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.67,0:13:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都三百多岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm over 300 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.56,0:13:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,想早起都不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beauty sleep isn't optional.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.40,0:13:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在调查我们之前说的那事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been looking into the, uh, thing we discussed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.16,0:13:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有所发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I got a lead,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.77,0:13:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它受到了厉害的咒语保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's guarded by a violent enchantment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.39,0:13:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一个咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a spell to…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.89,0:13:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,来破解咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}break the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.20,0:13:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡比利恩符咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Cabirian invocation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.08,0:13:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,很容易得到 什么咒都能破解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy to obtain. Good all-purpose disenchantment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.31,0:13:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 多谢 - 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Great. Thanks. - Uh, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.47,0:13:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不建议外行人使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not recommended for amateurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.98,0:13:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}In inexperienced hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.34,0:13:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,操作符咒可能会失控\N{\fnArial\fs30}the invocation has a way of fizzling out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.58,0:13:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.64,0:13:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你或许用得上我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.09,0:13:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁可碰运气 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take my chances. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.31,0:14:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.55,0:14:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能解释的 - 省省吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I-I can explain. - Yeah, don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.29,0:14:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你三个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got three choices…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.11,0:14:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,被捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get arrested,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,被阉 滚蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}get your bits blown off, or get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.22,0:14:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好吧 我还是走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, all right. I think I'll, uh, think get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 这还差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. - Attaboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.49,0:14:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey ya, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.48,0:14:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,案子进展如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the case?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.91,0:14:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.58,0:14:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我是来拯救你的蛋蛋的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it looks like I, uh, I'm here to save your sac.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.31,0:14:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you were right. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.02,0:15:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该像之前那样单独行动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't have gone off solo like I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.97,0:15:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我犯蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.43,0:15:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.43,0:15:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还自私 很混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}And selfish. It was a douche move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.00,0:15:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你自己来查案 就为了教训我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're doing this case by yourself to teach me a lesson,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.66,0:15:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要的 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't have to, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.26,0:15:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.88,0:15:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.08,0:15:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,拓印了你的笔记本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took an etching off your notepad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.48,0:15:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是决定来看看圣路易斯自杀之屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I decided to take a crack at the, uh, St. Louis suicide house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.54,0:15:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这里啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you know about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.56,0:15:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谷歌上查了个大概\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the basics from google.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.09,0:15:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一家搬进长期闲置的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The family moves into a long-vacant house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一周后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, one week later,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.02,0:15:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,三人自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}three of 'em dead by their own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.47,0:15:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了女儿 全家灭门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whole family wiped out except for the daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.37,0:15:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而房子还在她名下\N{\fnArial\fs30}which the house is still under her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.77,0:15:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜刚刚差点阉了你的应该就是她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm figuring she's the one who nearly unmanned you back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.61,0:15:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不明白的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But see, here's what I don't get.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.81,0:15:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,悬案是一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, a cold case is one thing, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.60,0:15:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这案子都多老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is subzero.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.95,0:15:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且也没什么跟我们相关的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, there's nothing even in our wheelhouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.94,0:15:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你知道什么我不知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you know something I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.72,0:15:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.25,0:16:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这栋长期闲置的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That "long-vacant home"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.82,0:16:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾是记录者一个分部的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}used to be a men of letters chapter house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.62,0:16:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得马格纳斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember Magnus?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.90,0:16:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个差点把我做成标本的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean the dickwad ex-men of letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.22,0:16:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋前记录者吗 记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}that tried to make a zoo exhibit out of me? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.51,0:16:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被开除之前 建了一个维特箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before he was expelled, he built werther,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.62,0:16:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个魔法箱子 有致命的警报系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}a magical box with a deadly alarm system.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.34,0:16:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,维特箱就埋在那栋房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Werther is buried somewhere in that house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.60,0:16:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,本该是该有人守卫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was supposed to have been guarded,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.60,0:16:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我猜阿比顿58年\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm guessing that plan went out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.05,0:16:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了所有人后就没人来守了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when Abaddon massacred the entire membership in '58.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.97,0:16:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后房子一直闲置\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the house stayed in limbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.29,0:16:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到被一个幸运的家庭买下\N{\fnArial\fs30}until some lucky family bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.92,0:16:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,维特箱是个定时炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Werther's a time bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.94,0:16:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,得想办法拆除它\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it needs to be defused.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.01,0:16:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不仅与我们有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not only is this in our wheelhouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.87,0:16:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,更是我们的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's our responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.19,0:16:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our responsibility?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.36,0:16:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're men of letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.41,0:16:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的遗产\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.70,0:16:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你说是案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hey, if you say this is a case…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.35,0:16:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就算我一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.47,0:16:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不介意的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you'll have me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.21,0:17:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.12,0:17:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.35,0:17:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.52,0:17:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个人想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fella tried to…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.08,0:17:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.43,0:17:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.52,0:17:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, tell me you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.54,0:17:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我叫德怀特·特维利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but my name is… is Dwight Twilley.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.12,0:17:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是邻里联防队的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with the neighborhood watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.36,0:17:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在调查几起最近的入室事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're… we're looking into a few recent break-ins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你看见那人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you saw the guy and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.47,0:17:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,能跟我描述一下的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}… y-you could give a description,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would be mighty helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.33,0:17:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,能占用您一点时间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I could… if I could just have a minute of your… time?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.09,0:17:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,高个 白人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tall white fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.80,0:17:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,头发挺好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.66,0:17:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你家不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a nice house you have here, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.23,0:17:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.96,0:17:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏茜 一个人住吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suzie. You live alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.46,0:17:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我和嘉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just me and Gus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.32,0:17:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gus?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.22,0:18:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人住这么大的房子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So all alone in this big house, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.32,0:18:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定很孤单吧 就算有嘉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must get lonely, even with, uh, Gus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.47,0:18:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我习惯了一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I'm used to alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.53,0:18:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I'm fine, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.10,0:19:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个人住很久了 自从…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been alone here since, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.19,0:19:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,80年代吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}'80?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.24,0:19:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一家人死后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After my family died,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.79,0:19:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我姨妈保琳曾搬进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}my aunt Pauline moved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.41,0:19:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她照顾我 养了我几年\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took care of me, raised me for a few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.24,0:19:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.96,0:19:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, what… what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.30,0:19:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你姨妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}To your aunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.40,0:19:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.46,0:19:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫她别去地下室的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told her not to go in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.53,0:19:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能进地下室啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one goes in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.96,0:20:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下室里有什么 苏茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in the basement, Suzie?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.48,0:20:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.71,0:20:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.59,0:20:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的社交能力虽然生疏了 但我不傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}My social skills may be rusty, but I'm no idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.22,0:20:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经几个月没人按过我的门铃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doorbell hasn't rung in months,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.27,0:20:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后一小时内就来了两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and two visitors in one hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.02,0:20:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个试图闯入\N{\fnArial\fs30}One breaking in,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.78,0:20:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个来问我各种问题…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the other asking all sorts of q-questions about…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.95,0:20:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 我是邻里联防队的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, I was from the neighborhood watch. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.82,0:20:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 邻里联防队 得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, neighborhood watch. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.32,0:20:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看过这个家了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, you seen this house?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.34,0:21:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里只有一样东西值得偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one thing in here worth gettin' at,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.06,0:21:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且绝对不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it sure as hell ain't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 你是为箱子而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - You came for the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.02,0:21:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.49,0:21:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是谁把那破玩意留在了下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever left that godforsaken thing down there…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.84,0:21:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道总有一日会有人来取\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew someday, someone would come for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.50,0:21:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓绝不让他们得逞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swore never to let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.35,0:21:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就在楼下 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's downstairs, isn't… isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.60,0:21:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我弟弟 我们是来帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my brother. And we're here to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.03,0:21:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫他上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call him up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.98,0:21:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.85,0:21:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call him up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.81,0:21:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 好吧 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now! - Okay. Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.73,0:21:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.12,0:21:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.46,0:21:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫你马上上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants you up here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.09,0:21:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.23,0:22:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.33,0:22:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.39,0:22:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去 出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out! Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.57,0:22:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们这些混蛋 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You bastards! - Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.90,0:22:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们把它放出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.22,0:22:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.42,0:22:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.08,0:22:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你做了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have any idea what you've done?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.17,0:22:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下 我们好商量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the gun down. We can talk about this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.42,0:22:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.57,0:22:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏茜 想我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Suzie. You miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.68,0:22:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.39,0:22:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她怎么了 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's wrong with her? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.79,0:22:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.70,0:22:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.13,0:22:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.32,0:22:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 苏茜 就这么对待家人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Suze. That any way to treat your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.95,0:23:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 苏茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Suzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.49,0:23:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.92,0:23:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有计划 毫无防备\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have a plan. You don't have a defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.45,0:23:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.06,0:23:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你害了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did this to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.98,0:23:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你把它放出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.38,0:23:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你睡着了 我们却死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We died while you slept.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.41,0:23:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.84,0:23:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 苏茜 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Suzie! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.47,0:23:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suzie?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.79,0:23:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你们 够了 住口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! No! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.93,0:23:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.11,0:23:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suzie!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.93,0:24:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏茜 让我进去 我能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suzie, let me in! I can help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.11,0:24:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 苏茜 那是幻觉 - 你不用难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Suzie, it's not real! - You don't have to be sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.84,0:24:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不用一个人待着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't have to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.90,0:24:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏茜 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suzie, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.45,0:24:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.46,0:24:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏茜 让我进去 我能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suzie! Hey, let me in. I can help you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.43,0:24:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你们 别说了 - 苏茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, please, no. - Suzie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.33,0:24:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.25,0:24:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.84,0:24:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suzie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.37,0:25:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.62,0:25:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个家里活了40年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survived 40 years in this house,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.98,0:25:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直锁住那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}keeping that thing on lockdown,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.61,0:25:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果你个傻瓜一来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one visit from a putz like you…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.86,0:25:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 真对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, okay? I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.38,0:25:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉对我有个屁用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lot of good "sorry" does me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.06,0:25:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.73,0:25:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…at…me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.22,0:25:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在那儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.74,0:25:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个因你错误的任务而死的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}First casualty of your misguided mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.23,0:25:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过死个人对你来说又如何呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what's another human life to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.85,0:25:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,做什么都值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything's worth it,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.41,0:25:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你俩能活下来就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}as long as you two make it out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.33,0:25:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的搜寻怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how's that search going?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.90,0:25:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,接近找到解决办法了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any closer to a cure?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.36,0:25:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.76,0:25:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.73,0:26:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得迪恩不听话 鲁莽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Dean's the wild card, the loose cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.82,0:26:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你还不明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.24,0:26:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟女巫做交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making deals with witches,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.68,0:26:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在楼下打开潘多拉之盒\N{\fnArial\fs30}opening pandora's box down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.03,0:26:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才是鲁莽的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the reckless one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.12,0:26:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了留住你那个没救的哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll do anything to keep clinging to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.90,0:26:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都肯做\N{\fnArial\fs30}that doomed brother of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.79,0:26:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要死多少人 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many more will die, Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.09,0:26:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也明白 必须有人阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it. You have to be stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.99,0:26:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你自己能阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the only one who can stop you is you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.01,0:26:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it, Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.15,0:26:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远结束这场闹剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}End this farce once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.49,0:26:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.67,0:26:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说你会需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you you'd need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.48,0:26:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.99,0:26:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我救你的方式一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same way I just saved you…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.38,0:26:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.84,0:26:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就觉得你可能招架不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had a feeling you might be in over your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.78,0:26:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you can't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.88,0:26:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果迪恩看到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Dean sees you…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.77,0:26:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.70,0:26:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.18,0:27:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.10,0:27:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.21,0:27:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.27,0:27:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 不可能是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, it can't be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.59,0:27:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.07,0:27:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 不管你看见了什么 都不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, whatever you're seeing, it's not real!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.14,0:27:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他来说很真实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real enough to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.79,0:27:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.44,0:27:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看不到我的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't see me, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.98,0:27:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经深陷幻境了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's too far gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.26,0:27:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,能唤醒他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you wake him up?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.74,0:27:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的驱散咒只够一个人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only brought enough dispelling magic for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.64,0:27:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁叫你不告诉我不止我们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe if you'd told me we'd have company…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.89,0:27:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有什么「我们」 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There is no "we." - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.80,0:27:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你自己解决吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this all on by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.06,0:27:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过现在情况对你很不利哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the odds are totally stacked against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.91,0:28:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.47,0:28:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,咒语的法力很强大啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the spell's got its hooks in deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.47,0:28:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果想让他醒过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want him woken up…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.54,0:28:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得从根源破除咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna have to rip this enchantment out by the root.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.82,0:28:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The box.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.62,0:28:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要能破解保险机制\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can figure out the fail-safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.63,0:28:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能解除咒语 找到法典\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can break the spell and get the codex.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.23,0:28:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻觉让苏茜自尽而亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suzie's hallucinations drove her to suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.31,0:28:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的家人也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same thing happened to her family.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.97,0:28:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,维特的幻觉刚刚差点也害死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Werther's illusions tried to do the same thing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.78,0:28:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.20,0:28:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以迪恩这样 我不能丢下他一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I can't leave Dean alone like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.56,0:28:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.57,0:28:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把这个帅小伙绑起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll just have to tie up the bonny lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.10,0:28:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.79,0:28:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 迪恩 你还打算这样多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dean. How long you gonna keep this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.26,0:28:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不跟我说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The silent treatment for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.82,0:28:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们有好多话要聊呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got so much to catch up on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.52,0:28:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真好 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look, it's good to see you, okay? It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.77,0:28:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我已经说了 你不是本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}But like I said, you ain't Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.92,0:28:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.18,0:28:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 我也挺郁闷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, shoot. - Hey, I'm bummed out, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.13,0:28:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你是虚构的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are just a figment, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.24,0:28:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我大脑的潜意识产生的幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're … you're subconscious junk my brain's throwing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.23,0:28:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻碍我回到现实中去\N{\fnArial\fs30}to distract me from getting back to reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.05,0:28:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,虚构 幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Figment"? "Junk"?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.93,0:28:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll try not to be offended.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.94,0:29:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不相信我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.74,0:29:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前就帮你逃离过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've gotten you outta here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.03,0:29:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说了 如果我是你潜意识的幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, if all I am is your "subconscious junk, "
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.93,0:29:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又怎么会欺骗你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, then how can I lead you wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.34,0:29:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.92,0:29:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,绕了一圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}A perfect circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.73,0:29:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别看我啊 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look at me, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.76,0:29:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你自己选的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.72,0:29:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 上面刻着一些铭文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it is. There's some kind of inscription.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.10,0:29:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是草书 但已经被磨得看不清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's some kind of cursive, but the light source has dimmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.12,0:29:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我之前对你们记录者评价不高\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I've said about your kind,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.57,0:29:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但打造了这个箱子的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but… the man who came up with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.71,0:29:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这精美的做工\N{\fnArial\fs30}The craftsmanship of the box,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.99,0:29:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怨毒的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}the sadism of the spellwork…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.08,0:29:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's all so…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.35,0:29:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,太美太巴洛克了\N{\fnArial\fs30}deliciously baroque.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.84,0:29:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.46,0:30:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.77,0:30:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,太诡异了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now that is just creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.75,0:30:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,本尼 不管你是什么 我得出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny … whoever you are … I need to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.65,0:30:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你「得」出去 不代表你想出去 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Need" and "want" are two different things, ain't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.41,0:30:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是幻境 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all a figment, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.26,0:30:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你 左和右\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, me, left, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.55,0:30:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但无论你选择哪条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no matter which way you turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.83,0:30:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后还是来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}you keep ending up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.32,0:30:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅得想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta wonder …
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.66,0:30:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是这种幻境\N{\fnArial\fs30}why this figment?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.02,0:30:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.44,0:30:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.80,0:30:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是你已经知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing you don't already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.40,0:30:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己想待在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where you wanna be …
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.56,0:30:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的快乐天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}your happy place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.82,0:30:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不真的想离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't really wanna leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.18,0:31:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,[拉丁文]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.02,0:31:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要让箱子失效\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To silence the box…"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.90,0:31:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,[拉丁文]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.21,0:31:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,要止其渴\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Slake its thirst…"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.17,0:31:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,[拉丁文]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.96,0:31:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,以我同族人之血\N{\fnArial\fs30}"With…the blood of our own."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.63,0:31:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.19,0:31:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,同族人之血 什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The blood of its own…" what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.76,0:31:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,以我同族人之血\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The blood of our own."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.72,0:31:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,记录者的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men of letters blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.95,0:31:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,传人的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legacy blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.51,0:31:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}My blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.58,0:31:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我们第一次见时你对我说了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember what you said to me when we first met?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.55,0:31:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,说这地方纯粹什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the purity of this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.98,0:31:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 走慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.29,0:31:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.15,0:31:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.12,0:31:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}This?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.25,0:32:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里 你不用去找麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place, you don't have to go looking for a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.03,0:32:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需静静地等上一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to is be still for one moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.63,0:32:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦就找上门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that fight will come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.81,0:32:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你在这里的原因 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you're here, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.68,0:32:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你渴望的纯粹\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the purity you crave …
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.85,0:32:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用背负任何后果的杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}killing with no consequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.30,0:32:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 本尼 我不想再打下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Benny, I don't wanna fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.75,0:32:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经厌倦打斗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired of fightin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.14,0:32:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但血印没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark ain't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.59,0:32:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…你既不能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…can't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.22,0:32:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也不想留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't wanna stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.87,0:32:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下有点麻烦了 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit of a bind, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.87,0:32:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息是 总有第三条路可选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good thing there's always a third way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.07,0:32:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能说自己从没想过吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't say you haven't been thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.15,0:32:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是不可能的 永远不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ain't gonna happen, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.44,0:32:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.28,0:33:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.03,0:33:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种纯粹 那种荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}The purity, the honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.58,0:33:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那没什么荣耀可言\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no honor in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.59,0:33:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你就干等着被血印重新控制住吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you just wanna wait for the mark to reclaim you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.28,0:33:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到人间 在战斗中牺牲 然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go out swinging, die topside, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.25,0:33:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许还要误伤几个人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe kill a few humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.43,0:33:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,害死小卡 害死你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill Cass? Kill your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.93,0:33:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 那可真是荣耀至极啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's mighty honorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.24,0:33:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.75,0:33:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我忘了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I-I'm sorry. I forgot…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.84,0:33:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}about your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.05,0:33:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算让萨姆和小卡干掉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna get Sam and Cass to put you down?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.24,0:33:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得他俩会遵守约定吗 别逗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think they're gonna keep that agreement? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.52,0:33:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 就算他俩照做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, let's say they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.19,0:33:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他俩还能从那件事里缓过来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think they will ever recover from that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.30,0:33:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会毁了他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will ruin them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.75,0:33:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的这个备用计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}This little backup plan of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.99,0:33:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想了好一阵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you've been thinking about it for a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.98,0:33:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你因此痛不欲生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's been gnawin' at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.32,0:33:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能把那苦差事留给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't leave that job to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.43,0:34:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.87,0:34:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在现实里 你睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out there? You're sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.01,0:34:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里做出正确的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make the right choice in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.20,0:34:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就能长睡不醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll sleep forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.97,0:34:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不会伤害到任何人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you won't ever hurt anyone ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.31,0:34:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人不需要知道 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one needs to know, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.12,0:34:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在炼狱里发生的一切 只会留在炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens in purgatory, stays in purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.19,0:35:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道这样能起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know this will work?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.58,0:35:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.85,0:35:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,起作用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.21,0:35:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确喜欢这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always did love it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.22,0:35:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里结束也不差 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's as good a place as any to call it a day, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.45,0:35:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.48,0:35:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.09,0:36:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.53,0:36:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,它想要更多的血 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wants more, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.31,0:36:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它要你全部的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wants it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.22,0:36:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,法典…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The codex…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.58,0:36:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,通向解决办法的途径\N{\fnArial\fs30}path to the cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.21,0:36:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.07,0:36:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如它还要 我就满足它\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it wants more, it'll get more.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.80,0:36:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.73,0:36:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如我真的必须动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I really had to,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.23,0:36:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.52,0:36:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是真正的本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the real Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.52,0:36:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不会让我那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}would never let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.11,0:36:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经讨论过那个了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}We already covered that, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.75,0:36:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我让你这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.45,0:36:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道还有什么会阻止我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what else won't let me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.51,0:37:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我胳膊上的这玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing on my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.83,0:37:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 这个血印…\N{\fnArial\fs30}For better or worse, the mark…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.66,0:37:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}it wants me alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.75,0:37:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, pal,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.99,0:37:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.38,0:37:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,要打开了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's opening, Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.76,0:37:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nearly there!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.09,0:37:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.52,0:38:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 不管你看到的是什么 都是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, whatever you're seeing, it's … it's a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.69,0:38:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? It's not real!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.03,0:38:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.77,0:38:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.63,0:38:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.56,0:38:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.50,0:38:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是唯一的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.88,0:38:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它需要传人的血 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It needs legacy blood… - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.31,0:38:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,足以让人送命的量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough to take a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.09,0:38:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.78,0:38:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不非得来自一个人 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't have to come from just one legacy, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.57,0:38:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它需要更多的血 就拿我的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It needs more blood, it can have mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.24,0:38:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.48,0:39:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点过头了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Overkill, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.09,0:39:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打破了诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we broke the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.79,0:39:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,箱子如今只是个箱子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The box is just a box.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.82,0:39:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只是废弃金属了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now it's scrap metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.79,0:39:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.95,0:39:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm great.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.93,0:39:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以出发了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You road ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.79,0:39:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.63,0:39:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这说明了点问题 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That says something, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.38,0:39:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,维特把我们分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Werther splits us up in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.36,0:39:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不到一小时 我们就都濒临死亡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Within an hour, we're both on the brink of death?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.77,0:39:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉昨天单独行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about yesterday, going rogue on you like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.31,0:40:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 迪恩 别道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, Dean? Don't apologize. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.77,0:40:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我俩扯平了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that makes us even.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.43,0:40:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙想要告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The universe is trying to tell us something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.72,0:40:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都早该知道的道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}we both should already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.24,0:40:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在一起比分开要强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're stronger together than apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.02,0:40:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西那么有价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what could possibly be so valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.58,0:40:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要这么邪恶的咒语来保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it takes a spell that nasty to protect it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.00,0:40:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.56,0:40:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.33,0:40:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要确保它的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll keep it safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.49,0:40:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 牛仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hello, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.44,0:40:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.15,0:40:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.37,0:40:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.65,0:40:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻译书\N{\fnArial\fs30}To translate the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.84,0:41:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到治愈血印的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find a cure for the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.25,0:41:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.14,0:41:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.21,0:41:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wh…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.56,0:41:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the hell is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.19,0:41:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,保险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.33,0:41:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,舒服吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comfortable?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.02,0:41:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们达成了协议的 巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had an agreement, giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.68,0:41:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,协议依旧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The agreement stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.35,0:41:22.12,Title,0,0,0,0,,你要破解《诅咒之书》\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will decrypt The Book of The Damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.12,0:41:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我哥哥找到治愈办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}and find me a cure for my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.74,0:41:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你从书里唯一能得到的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is all you will get from the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.24,0:41:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会烧了那本书 杀死克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll burn the book, then I'll kill Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.11,0:41:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在那之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But until then…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.95,0:41:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的奴隶吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your slave?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.09,0:41:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能把我就这么丢在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't … you can't just leave me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.20,0:41:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想出去吗 快点干活儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna out? Hurry up. Get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.14,0:41:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个大坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You big bampot!
